        "name": "yellow",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They love to gath­\ner in smelly areas\nwhere sludge ac­\fcumulates, making\nthe stench around\nthem worse.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "gold",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its body is made\nof a powerful poi­\nson. Touching it\faccidentally will\ncause a fever that\nrequires bed rest.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "silver",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "As it moves, a\nvery strong poison\nleaks from it,\fmaking the ground\nthere barren for\nthree years.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "crystal",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "From MUK’s body seeps a foul fluid that\ngives off a nose-bendingly horrible\nstench.\fJust one drop of this POKéMON’s body\nfluid can turn a pool stagnant and\nrancid.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ruby",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This POKéMON’s favorite food is\nanything that is repugnantly filthy.\nIn dirty towns where people think\fnothing of throwing away litter on the\nstreets, MUK are certain to gather.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It prefers warm and humid habitats.\nIn the summertime, the toxic substances\nin its body intensify, making MUK reek like\nputrid kitchen garbage.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "emerald",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/9/"
      }
    },
    {
